  "question": "Business Requirement Description:\nThe following describes a Sales Point Management System. The system’s main features might include:\n1.Sales Plan Management: The company creates reasonable sales plans for sales points. The main Attributes include sales plan name, sales plan description, start date, and end date.\n2.Sales Point Management: Each sales point includes a unique sales point ID, name, and address. Each sales point is associated with a specific venue, company, and city.\n3.Device Management: Each device includes a device ID, device name, and device model. Each device is assigned to a corresponding sales point for use.\n4.City Management: Each sales point is associated with a city, which includes a city ID, city name, and province.\n5.Company Management: Each sales point is associated with a company, which includes a company ID, company name, and company address.\n6.Venue Management: Each sales point is associated with a venue, which includes a venue ID, venue name, and venue description.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0414\nCREATE TABLE `company` (\n  `company_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `company_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `company_address` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`company_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `city` (\n  `city_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `city_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `province` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`city_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `venue` (\n  `venue_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `venue_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `venue_description` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`venue_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `sales_point` (\n  `sales_point_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `sales_point_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `sales_point_address` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `venue_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `company_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `city_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`sales_point_id`),\n  KEY `sales_point_ibfk_1` (`venue_id`),\n  KEY `sales_point_ibfk_2` (`company_id`),\n  KEY `sales_point_ibfk_3` (`city_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `sales_point_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`venue_id`) REFERENCES `venue` (`venue_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `sales_point_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`company_id`) REFERENCES `company` (`company_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `sales_point_ibfk_3` FOREIGN KEY (`city_id`) REFERENCES `city` (`city_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `device` (\n  `device_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `device_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `device_model` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `sales_point_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`device_id`),\n  KEY `device_ibfk_1` (`sales_point_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `device_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`sales_point_id`) REFERENCES `sales_point` (`sales_point_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `sales_plan` (\n  `sales_plan_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `sales_plan_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `sales_plan_description` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `start_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `end_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`sales_plan_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
